  "question": {
    "text": "If \\(1^2 \\cdot\\left({ }^{15} C_1\\right)+2^2 \\cdot\\left({ }^{15} C_2\\right)+3^2 \\cdot\\left({ }^{15} C_3\\right)+\\ldots\\) \\(+15^2 \\cdot\\left({ }^{15} C_{15}\\right)=2^m \\cdot 3^n \\cdot 5^k\\), where \\(m, n, k \\in \\mathbf{N}\\), then \\(\\mathrm{m}+\\mathrm{n}+\\mathrm{k}\\) is equal to :",
